# 🛡️ DeFi Lending Security Audit

[![Security Audit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Security-Audit%20In%20Progress-orange)]()
[![Solidity](https://img.shields.io/badge/Solidity-0.8.20-blue)]()
[![Foundry](https://img.shields.io/badge/Built%20With-Foundry-yellow)]()
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)]()

> **A full-spectrum security audit and functional test automation suite for a DeFi lending protocol.**

---

## 📋 Table of Contents

- [Overview](#overview)
- [Project Structure](#project-structure)
- [Audit Scope](#audit-scope)
- [Getting Started](#getting-started)
- [Running Tests](#running-tests)
- [Static Analysis](#static-analysis)
- [Gas Optimization](#gas-optimization)
- [Findings Summary](#findings-summary)
- [Deliverables](#deliverables)

---

## 🔍 Overview

This project conducts a **comprehensive security assessment and functional validation** of a DeFi lending protocol. It combines:

- **Automated Static Analysis** using Slither and Foundry
- **Rigorous Manual Code Review** for logic and economic vulnerabilities
- **Unit & Integration Testing** with high coverage targets (>95%)
- **Attack Simulations** for reentrancy, flash loans, and price manipulation
- **Gas Optimization Analysis** for mainnet deployment readiness

The ultimate goal is to provide a **production-ready codebase** with a detailed audit report, giving the client and investors technical confidence for a **safe mainnet launch**.

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
DeFi-Lending-Security-Audit/
├── src/                          # Smart contract source code
│   ├── LendingPool.sol           # Core lending pool contract
│   ├── InterestRateModel.sol     # Interest rate calculation engine
│   ├── interfaces/               # Contract interfaces
│   │   ├── ILendingPool.sol
│   │   └── IInterestRateModel.sol
│   └── libraries/
│       └── WadRayMath.sol        # Fixed-point math library
├── test/                         # Foundry test suites
│   ├── LendingPool.t.sol         # Core unit & integration tests
│   ├── InterestRateModel.t.sol   # Interest model validation
│   ├── attacks/                  # Attack vector simulations
│   │   ├── Reentrancy.t.sol
│   │   └── FlashLoanExploit.t.sol
│   └── invariants/               # Invariant/fuzz testing
│       └── LendingPoolInvariant.t.sol
├── script/
│   └── Deploy.s.sol              # Deployment script
├── analysis/                     # Static analysis configs & reports
│   ├── slither.config.json
│   └── gas-report.md
├── docs/                         # Audit documentation
│   ├── threat-model.md
│   └── test-plan.md
├── .github/workflows/
│   └── security-audit.yml        # CI/CD pipeline
├── Audit-Report.md               # Final audit report
├── foundry.toml                  # Foundry configuration
└── README.md                     # This file
```

---

## 🎯 Audit Scope

| Category              | Focus Area                                              | Severity Target |
|-----------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|-----------------|
| **Reentrancy**        | External calls before state updates, cross-function reentrancy | Critical |
| **Flash Loan Exploits** | Price oracle manipulation, uncollateralized borrowing | Critical |
| **Interest Rate Logic** | Calculation precision, overflow/underflow, rate manipulation | High |
| **Collateral & Liquidation** | Health factor accuracy, liquidation incentives, dust attacks | High |
| **Access Control**    | Privileged functions, ownership transfers, role management | High |
| **Gas Optimization**  | Storage patterns, loop efficiency, calldata usage       | Medium |
| **Economic Attacks**  | Sandwich attacks, MEV extraction, governance manipulation | Medium |

---

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- [Foundry](https://book.getfoundry.sh/getting-started/installation) (forge, cast, anvil)
- [Slither](https://github.com/crytic/slither) (optional, for static analysis)
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) >= 18 (for tooling scripts)

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/mudassir444/DeFi-Lending-Security-Audit.git
cd DeFi-Lending-Security-Audit

# Install Foundry dependencies
forge install

# Build contracts
forge build
```

---

## 🧪 Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
forge test

# Run tests with verbose output
forge test -vvvv

# Run specific test file
forge test --match-path test/attacks/Reentrancy.t.sol

# Run with gas reporting
forge test --gas-report

# Run fuzz tests with increased runs
forge test --fuzz-runs 10000
```

---

## 🔬 Static Analysis

```bash
# Run Slither analysis
slither src/ --config-file analysis/slither.config.json

# Generate Slither report
slither src/ --print human-summary
```

---

## ⛽ Gas Optimization

```bash
# Generate gas snapshot
forge snapshot

# Compare gas changes
forge snapshot --diff
```

