- [x] Smart contract source code with inline documentation
- [x] Comprehensive test suite (unit, integration, fuzz, invariant)
- [x] Attack simulation test cases
- [ ] Static analysis report (Slither)
- [ ] Gas optimization report
- [ ] Final Audit Report (`Audit-Report.md`)

