| USDC/USDG | USDC `0xA0b86991c6218b36c1d19D4a2e9Eb0cE3606eB48` | USDG `0xe343167631d89B6Ffc58B88d6b7fB0228795491D` | 0xeda62d2906d0edf26d40c793d581609552a44a87f618a98ff76ebe8dde4b7edb | 2026-09-10 |

